    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Equip, Combine, and Push Beyond Your Limits!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bound Survivor</strong> is a fast-paced, satisfying 2D pixel-art top-down roguelike action game.<br>In a battlefield swarming with monsters, you can equip multiple weapons\u2014each with unique <strong>bounds</strong>. Combine different bounds to trigger powerful synergies and craft your own wild build!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permanent Progression</strong>: Every run is a fresh challenge where luck and strategy go hand in hand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Weapon Loadouts</strong>: Break free from fixed builds\u2014dual-wield machine guns, or mix fireballs with blade storms. It\u2019s your call.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bound Combination System</strong>: Build powerful synergies just like in auto battlers. Different setups, different playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Pixel Art</strong>: Explosive effects, chaotic battles, and nostalgic visuals\u2014classic feel, modern flair.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find order in chaos. Survive the endless waves.</strong><br>How long can your weapon combo hold out?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605460/extras/288248f9b930aedbe0feaf80442c5295.avif?t=1745479197\" data-has-big width=800 height=444 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Equip, Combine, and Push Beyond Your Limits!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bound Survivor</strong> is a fast-paced, satisfying 2D pixel-art top-down roguelike action game.<br>In a battlefield swarming with monsters, you can equip multiple weapons\u2014each with unique <strong>bounds</strong>. Combine different bounds to trigger powerful synergies and craft your own wild build!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permanent Progression</strong>: Every run is a fresh challenge where luck and strategy go hand in hand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Weapon Loadouts</strong>: Break free from fixed builds\u2014dual-wield machine guns, or mix fireballs with blade storms. It\u2019s your call.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bound Combination System</strong>: Build powerful synergies just like in auto battlers. Different setups, different playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Pixel Art</strong>: Explosive effects, chaotic battles, and nostalgic visuals\u2014classic feel, modern flair.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find order in chaos. Survive the endless waves.</strong><br>How long can your weapon combo hold out?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605460/extras/288248f9b930aedbe0feaf80442c5295.avif?t=1745479197\" data-has-big width=800 height=444 /></span></p>",
